真っ直ぐ見つめて
Gaze straight at me...

495
00:46:06,733 --> 00:46:07,793
おねだりしてみて欲しいの?
Won't you pester me?

496
00:46:23,077 --> 00:46:24,027
お願いダーリン かわいい!
Please, darling... so cute!

497
00:46:29,698 --> 00:46:31,138
せーのっ! いにさんはいっ!
Ready, 1, 2, 3, go!

498
00:46:43,075 --> 00:46:43,835
これよりご覧いただきますのは
What we present to you now...

499
00:46:43,985 --> 00:46:45,615
カブキ者たちの栄枯盛衰
is the rise and fall of the kabuki performers.

500
00:46:46,135 --> 00:46:48,375
時代は常に日進月歩
Times are constantly changing at a rapid pace,

501
00:46:48,375 --> 00:46:49,145
聞いてってよ老若男女
listen up, young and old alike!

502
00:46:49,405 --> 00:46:51,755
一見は勧善懲悪
At first glance, punishing evil and rewarding good,

503
00:46:51,755 --> 00:46:52,575
悪者どもを一刀両断
cutting down villains in one stroke.

504
00:46:52,575 --> 00:46:54,135
「でもホントにそれだけで楽しいの?」
"But is it really fun with just that?"

505
00:46:54,965 --> 00:46:56,315
もうなんだってこんにゃく問答
It's all just a confusing debate now.

506
00:47:02,205 --> 00:47:03,095
どこからともなく現れて
Appearing out of nowhere,

507
00:47:03,095 --> 00:47:04,495
すぐどこか行っちゃって神出鬼没
and disappearing just as quickly like a phantom.

508
00:47:04,665 --> 00:47:06,575
チャンスを待ったら一日千秋
Waiting for a chance feels like a thousand years,

509
00:47:06,575 --> 00:47:08,275
追いかければ東奔西走
chasing after them means running all over.

510
00:47:08,755 --> 00:47:10,585
時代は常に千変万化
Times are always changing in a thousand ways,

511
00:47:10,585 --> 00:47:12,465
人の心は複雑怪奇
and human hearts are complex and bizarre.

512
00:47:12,465 --> 00:47:14,465
「でも本気でそんなこと言ってんの?」
"Do you really mean what you say?"

513
00:47:14,465 --> 00:47:16,475
もうどうにも満身創痍
I'm completely exhausted.

514
00:47:17,135 --> 00:47:20,285
めぐりめぐって夜の町
Wandering around the night town,

515
00:47:22,155 --> 00:47:25,175
キミは合図出し踊りだす
you give the signal and start to dance!

516
00:47:31,135 --> 00:47:32,495
華麗に花弁 散らすように
Spinning around like scattering flower petals,

517
00:47:37,105 --> 00:47:38,325
髪も振り乱して
tossing your hair about!

518
00:47:39,255 --> 00:47:43,395
一昨日、昨日、今日と、明日と、明後日と
The day before yesterday, yesterday, today, tomorrow, and the day after,

519
00:47:43,395 --> 00:47:45,395
この宴は続く
this banquet goes on.

520
00:47:45,935 --> 00:47:48,465
踊れ、歌エ、一心不乱に回レ!
Dance, sing, and spin with single-minded devotion!

521
00:47:49,595 --> 00:47:51,345
今宵は雪月花
Tonight is Setsugetsuka!

522
00:48:04,355 --> 00:48:05,065
この世に平安訪れるの?
Will peace ever visit this world?

523
00:48:05,225 --> 00:48:07,205
のべつ幕無し丁丁発止
Without lowering the curtain, with a bold start,

524
00:48:07,205 --> 00:48:10,095
兵ども千客万来 ひしめき合う群雄割拠
warlords gather from near and far,

525
00:48:10,095 --> 00:48:12,775
伸るか反るか一攫千金 気付いたら絶対絶命
win or lose, it's a make-or-break moment,

526
00:48:13,135 --> 00:48:15,075
「でも本音のとこ、どうなってんの?」
"But what is really on your mind?"

527
00:48:15,225 --> 00:48:17,225
もうまったく奇想天外
It's totally out of this world.

528
00:48:18,135 --> 00:48:21,105
たどりたどりて夜の町
Tracing our way through the night town,

529
00:48:24,085 --> 00:48:26,615
迷い一つなく踊りだす
we start dancing without a single hesitation.

530
00:48:32,025 --> 00:48:33,475
華麗に花弁 散らすように
Spinning around like scattering flower petals,

531
00:48:38,145 --> 00:48:39,365
髪も振り乱して
tossing your hair about!

532
