風で三つ、鳴呼、月出て四つ
Three for the wind, four when the moon rises,

539
00:49:27,251 --> 00:49:28,241
鳴らす鳴らす……
make it resound, make it resound...

540
00:49:29,551 --> 00:49:30,421
花で一つ、鳥で二つ
One for flowers, two for birds,

541
00:49:32,051 --> 00:49:33,321
手打ち鳴らす
clap your hands to the rhythm.

542
00:49:34,771 --> 00:49:36,291
風で三つ、鳴呼、月出て四つ
Three for the wind, four when the moon rises,

543
00:49:39,391 --> 00:49:40,381
鳴らす鳴らす……
make it resound, make it resound...

544
